TITLE Pure water pH 7 at 150C equilibrated with chrysotile and talc
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Chrysotile 0 10
    Talc       0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings SpCond_uS_cm
    10 PUNCH SC
END
